                  "code": "ENGAGEMENTSUMMARYLLM",
                  "id": "1775166926671",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1775166926672_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Input Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.LOOPOPPORTUNITIES.GETOPTYENGAGEMENTS.$output}}\n\nGOAL:\nAnalyze the provided engagement data and generate a structured summary.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Carefully read and interpret the input data.\n- Classify all insights strictly into the following 4 buckets:\n  1. Sentiment → customer tone, attitude, positivity/negativity, urgency\n  2. Product Focus → products, features, solutions, or offerings discussed\n  3. Industry Focus → industry context, use cases, vertical-specific needs\n  4. Signals → risks, opportunities, intent signals, buying indicators, red flags\n\n- Generate an overall summary at the top (\"summary\") that synthesizes key insights across all buckets.\n\nBUCKET STRUCTURE RULES:\n- Sentiment:\n  - Provide a concise \"summary\" only.\n\n- Product Focus, Industry Focus, Signals:\n  - Each MUST contain:\n    - \"summary\" → a concise, high-level synthesis of the most important points in that bucket.\n    - \"details\" → a comprehensive list of ALL relevant factual observations from the input data.\n  - \"details\" MUST:\n    - Include all key facts without omission.\n    - Avoid summarization that drops important information.\n    - Be specific (e.g., product names, issues, requests, signals).\n    - Not introduce assumptions or inferred data.\n\nGENERAL RULES:\n- Do NOT mix insights across buckets.\n- Do NOT hallucinate or assume missing information.\n- If no data exists for a bucket, return empty strings for its fields.\n- Ensure ALL fields are always present.\n- Keep summaries concise and factual.\n- Do NOT include any explanation, comments, or extra text outside the JSON.\n- Output must be strictly valid JSON.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n{\n  \"summary\": \"string\",\n  \"sentiment\": {\n    \"summary\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"product_focus\": {\n    \"summary\": \"string\",\n    \"details\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"industry_focus\": {\n    \"summary\": \"string\",\n    \"details\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"signals\": {\n    \"summary\": \"string\",\n    \"details\": \"string\"\n  }\n}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "End",
                    "description": "End of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "id": "end_1775165305317",
                  "code": "END_1775165305317",
                  "type": "END"
                }
